<description><![CDATA[<div>有时候很想活得像村上春树小说里的男主，普通但是品味良好，情绪淡淡但是经常被卷入突发事件，又出人意料得很容易进入异性关系。<br/><br/>然后我会遇到美丽的、古怪的、充满奇幻色彩但带着神秘创伤的女主们，像鹅卵石一样打破生活。<br/><br/>比如一位穿着红色风衣的女士在咖啡店拦下我，问我是否相信鸟类拥有前世记忆。接着我们开始约会，雀子会在凌晨四点打电话给我，问我是否在家附近见到一只衔着白头鹎的赤色狐狸。<br/><br/>在荒诞且幽默的剧情之后，她们毫无征兆地消失或是死亡。给我的心留下淡淡的伤痕。我已经不再是那个山田了。<br/><br/>原文 <a href="https://www.threads.com/share/GFfv6fZex" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.threads.com/share/GFfv6fZex</a></div><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9988.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/JPPk4hDTxZPrpl9jw8BSp84QZWuuR1W6d8KSuaKot5LbJBY1mTAOj_fG_Jqy_uUAPU1svOT1LN8BeB2DMwvs4l4cA97N5bPXJl9RgmudwiIGf9_YOQfgKkqftrFrEBoAU0hUzK-x8eBbvFxQreAc2Ib_bhYYBwdTozy9D549-Zytwv-iiNd0lLMUJ84mGT0oji8PL1N2QLmrFTF5hhBnJ9dTwqNSxi1zt5jTtEeV1mmdjrgs_vM_1iCVANPCa5NO4XVr_eDhj87NUxysRMSgQPY_niqg9sWyBmSVnSmnJEBHbZYTw5pJhUBGXse9A5XiAmRcbFZ5MWaRqM7hbPF_Dg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A1.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918E.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><blockquote style='border-left:3px solid #ccc;padding-left:8px;'><img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/JPPk4hDTxZPrpl9jw8BSp84QZWuuR1W6d8KSuaKot5LbJBY1mTAOj_fG_Jqy_uUAPU1svOT1LN8BeB2DMwvs4l4cA97N5bPXJl9RgmudwiIGf9_YOQfgKkqftrFrEBoAU0hUzK-x8eBbvFxQreAc2Ib_bhYYBwdTozy9D549-Zytwv-iiNd0lLMUJ84mGT0oji8PL1N2QLmrFTF5hhBnJ9dTwqNSxi1zt5jTtEeV1mmdjrgs_vM_1iCVANPCa5NO4XVr_eDhj87NUxysRMSgQPY_niqg9sWyBmSVnSmnJEBHbZYTw5pJhUBGXse9A5XiAmRcbFZ5MWaRqM7hbPF_Dg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;heigh